{
  "job_B20.18.2_20251003_114511": {
    "chunk_text": "ymbe III niht bi\u00f0 Sancte laurentius m\u00e6sse, and \u00fe\u00e6r is f\u00e6sten to. And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe V niht bi\u00f0 Sancte marian m\u00e6sse, and \u00fe\u00e6r is f\u00e6sten to. And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe X niht bi\u00f0 Sancte bartholomeus m\u00e6sse, and \u00fear is f\u00e6sten to. And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe IIII niht bi\u00f0 Sancte iohannes m\u00e6sse baptistae. And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe X niht bi\u00f0 Sancta marian m\u00e6sse, and \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe XIII niht bi\u00f0 Sancte matheus And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe III niht bi\u00f0 emniht. And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe V niht bi\u00f0 Sancte michaheles m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g. And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe IIII wucan and ymbe ane niht bi\u00f0 Sancte simones m\u00e6sse and Taddeus, and \u00fear is f\u00e6sten And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe IIII nihtum bi\u00f0 ealra halgena m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g, and \u00fe\u00e6r is f\u00e6sten to. And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe VI niht g\u00e6\u00f0 winter on tun. And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe IIII niht bi\u00f0 Martinus m\u00e6sse. And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe XII niht bi\u00f0 Sancte clementes m\u00e6sse, and \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe VII niht bi\u00f0 Sancte andreas m\u00e6sse, And \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe IIII niht bi\u00f0 middes wintres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g..",
